WEBVTT

00:49.966 --> 00:52.719
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, RELIGIONS,

00:52.802 --> 00:55.680
EVENTS, AND OCCUPATIONS
IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:56.347 --> 00:58.183
Why didn't you tell us that
Andrew was a murderer?

00:58.266 --> 01:00.602
I thought we were just going
to threaten them a bit!

01:01.352 --> 01:04.689
You said you didn't care about
anything as long as we got the food.

01:04.773 --> 01:07.650
I just opened the door because
the building representative asked me to.

01:07.734 --> 01:10.695
I had no idea
that it was something like this!

01:10.779 --> 01:12.197
I didn't know, either.

01:12.280 --> 01:14.449
Mr. Oh suggested this plan.

01:26.085 --> 01:27.253
Who are you?

01:57.784 --> 02:02.038
I'm Andrew. I've always wanted
to have superpowers.

02:08.920 --> 02:09.754
Sae-bom!

02:12.632 --> 02:13.675
Jung-kook, wake up!

02:17.595 --> 02:19.055
Good luck treating him.

02:19.889 --> 02:21.599
I'll protect Seo-yoon.

02:37.157 --> 02:40.118
I'll come to get you. Just wait a bit.

02:56.801 --> 02:59.804
You don't have a scar on your face.

02:59.888 --> 03:01.514
All of you, go to the gym.

03:01.598 --> 03:02.891
I'll bring those two later.

03:02.974 --> 03:05.518
Can't we take the food now?

03:07.896 --> 03:09.188
There are people in there.

03:13.818 --> 03:14.861
Let's go wait there.

03:16.070 --> 03:17.947
It's not a pretty sight for us to see.

03:20.825 --> 03:22.869
This is a bad environment
to be in with a kid…

03:28.291 --> 03:29.292
Mr. Lawyer.

03:30.043 --> 03:31.377
Stay here for a moment.

03:36.883 --> 03:38.718
You heard that noise, right?

03:43.473 --> 03:45.266
Is your brother all right?

03:45.350 --> 03:46.893
It seems you go see him often.

03:48.394 --> 03:50.104
You didn't go with her, did you?

03:50.188 --> 03:52.273
My brother is totally fine!

03:52.357 --> 03:54.359
He's extremely careful,

03:54.442 --> 03:57.403
and his wound made by the infected
hasn't changed at all, either.

03:57.487 --> 04:00.782
Now, let's go down.
We have to discuss Unit 501.

04:00.865 --> 04:03.910
The others will join us
when they're done with their business.

04:03.993 --> 04:05.161
Let's go.

04:05.912 --> 04:06.788
This is bothersome…

04:21.719 --> 04:24.764
Yi-hyun, bring the first-aid kit
and clean water.

04:29.018 --> 04:31.312
Mr. Kim, let me take a look.

04:43.074 --> 04:44.242
Hang in there for a bit.

04:45.201 --> 04:47.078
You'll be okay if you go to the hospital.

04:47.161 --> 04:50.415
But still, if I die,

04:51.833 --> 04:53.042
tell my wife…

04:54.627 --> 04:55.795
that I said I'm sorry,

04:57.588 --> 04:59.549
and that I love her.

05:00.133 --> 05:01.926
You tell her face to face.

05:02.427 --> 05:03.970
You can go out and get treated.

05:04.971 --> 05:05.805
Really?

05:06.347 --> 05:07.724
Do you really think I'll live?

05:07.807 --> 05:08.766
You will.

05:09.684 --> 05:12.770
It's just a small hole on your side.

05:13.479 --> 05:15.064
Is it really a small one?

05:15.815 --> 05:17.108
Is it true?

05:19.444 --> 05:20.611
Yi-hyun…

05:34.667 --> 05:36.085
Jung-kook, hang in there a bit.

05:42.008 --> 05:44.302
Sae-bom, Jung-kook…

05:45.636 --> 05:46.512
Yi-hyun.

05:47.597 --> 05:48.514
Yi-hyun!

05:49.432 --> 05:50.308
Look at me.

05:54.979 --> 05:56.814
We will get out of here alive…

05:58.900 --> 06:00.151
and we will arrest

06:01.235 --> 06:02.487
all of them.

06:42.777 --> 06:44.904
Jung-kook got stabbed
with a knife on his side.

06:44.987 --> 06:48.116
And Seo-yoon can't breathe well,
so have the medical staff ready.

06:48.908 --> 06:50.243
We can go inside.

06:50.326 --> 06:52.245
No, Seo-yoon is taken hostage.

06:53.454 --> 06:55.039
It'll be dangerous if you come in.

06:55.123 --> 06:56.332
Mr. Jung.

06:56.415 --> 06:59.919
I thought about the reason
you're doing this.

07:00.002 --> 07:01.170
Sae-bom has…

07:02.421 --> 07:03.631
the antibody, doesn't she?

07:05.091 --> 07:06.134
What if I say yes?

07:09.178 --> 07:10.930
Then you should give us what we want

07:11.681 --> 07:13.307
for Sae-bom to get out.

07:16.686 --> 07:20.815
Mr. Lawyer, stay with this kid
for a moment.

07:31.826 --> 07:34.245
I'm not a bad guy.

07:34.871 --> 07:36.205
What's your name?

07:42.170 --> 07:43.838
I know who you are.

07:44.589 --> 07:46.549
Where are you going?
You have to get tested!

07:46.632 --> 07:47.800
The hospital.

07:52.096 --> 07:56.309
WANTED FOR MURDER
CHOI JONG-WOOK, AGE 33

07:57.935 --> 08:00.938
You killed the real Ahn Kook-jin,
didn't you?

08:04.650 --> 08:06.068
How many did you kill

08:07.195 --> 08:08.946
with your face hidden like that?

08:48.194 --> 08:51.197
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD: AHN KOOK-JIN

09:09.340 --> 09:11.217
The infected are the same, though.

09:11.300 --> 09:15.221
They hide their real selves to hide
in the crowd and seek victims.

09:17.348 --> 09:19.058
They're ill because of the disease,

09:19.809 --> 09:21.561
and you're just insane.

09:24.647 --> 09:25.731
Hey, Mister.

09:26.524 --> 09:28.025
How long have you known this?

09:28.651 --> 09:30.528
I heard you started it!

09:32.613 --> 09:33.906
It's been a few days.

09:33.990 --> 09:36.617
I saw Andrew "taking care of"
the cleaning lady.

09:46.419 --> 09:47.795
Hold on!

09:47.878 --> 09:48.838
Wait.

09:50.214 --> 09:53.175
Andrew, the 11th floor is vacant.

09:53.259 --> 09:55.261
Wouldn't it be better
to hide the body there?

09:55.344 --> 09:57.722
If you do this on the neck,
you can make it look like

09:57.805 --> 09:59.098
it was done by the infected.

10:01.267 --> 10:04.979
So I told the building representative
right away.

10:05.771 --> 10:07.732
I have an offer for you.

10:08.649 --> 10:11.944
There's a way
to get rid of those we don't like.

10:12.778 --> 10:16.324
The building representative said yes,
so I told Andrew.

10:16.407 --> 10:17.575
I told him we'll help him

10:17.658 --> 10:19.160
so he should help us too.

10:20.911 --> 10:22.455
You should all be thanking me.

10:22.538 --> 10:26.876
I know you'll not like me saying this,
but I'm a top elite in society.

10:26.959 --> 10:30.796
I even did some acting to trick the couple
on the fifth floor, for all of you.

10:31.714 --> 10:33.174
How did you get into…

10:34.884 --> 10:36.177
Kim Se-hoon's house?

10:37.470 --> 10:39.680
I mentioned you,
and he opened the door for me.

10:41.599 --> 10:43.476
Ms. Yoon got hurt.

10:44.226 --> 10:45.519
Do you have a first-aid kit?

10:59.617 --> 11:02.244
You would've suffered less
if you just listened to me.

11:03.871 --> 11:05.831
I'LL LEAVE THE REMAINING FOOD AND WATER

11:13.881 --> 11:14.924
Andrew.

11:15.716 --> 11:16.842
This is limestone,

11:17.510 --> 11:19.845
and it can get rid of
the smell of blood completely.

11:28.187 --> 11:29.563
Stay there and talk.

11:30.272 --> 11:32.024
You're making me uneasy by moving.

11:32.608 --> 11:34.485
Mr. Kim is hurt.

11:36.862 --> 11:38.280
He has to go to the hospital.

11:38.948 --> 11:41.033
After you two do what you must do.

11:42.118 --> 11:44.870
You can go outside, right? And…

11:47.706 --> 11:49.625
Are you communicating
with someone outside?

11:53.546 --> 11:55.798
What in the world
are you all talking about?

11:55.881 --> 11:57.842
Please explain so we can understand.

12:03.222 --> 12:07.393
We told the cleaners and the lawyer,

12:07.977 --> 12:10.104
but we didn't get to tell you two yet.

12:11.605 --> 12:13.566
You told my husband too?

12:13.649 --> 12:16.527
Yes, I visited him once.

12:17.027 --> 12:19.989
When he heard the 5th floor
and the 15th floor had a lot of food,

12:20.781 --> 12:22.116
he loved the idea.

12:41.343 --> 12:43.471
Mr. Jung had it.

12:53.647 --> 12:55.316
You've been secretly reporting

12:56.150 --> 12:58.736
about the situations going on in here?

12:59.570 --> 13:02.114
You must've received something
and kept it to yourselves.

13:02.198 --> 13:04.617
Under the condition
of monitoring us in here, right?

13:06.202 --> 13:07.453
Hello?

13:08.370 --> 13:09.622
Is anyone there?

13:14.460 --> 13:16.962
I'm the building representative
of Building 101.

13:17.922 --> 13:21.717
I'm in charge of managing
the apartments, so talk to me…

13:28.933 --> 13:29.808
Hello?

13:33.020 --> 13:34.480
Anyone there?

13:34.563 --> 13:36.565
I told them everything.

13:38.984 --> 13:40.277
What did you tell them?

13:43.113 --> 13:46.450
Did you spread your delusions to them?

13:46.534 --> 13:48.536
Yes, all of them.

13:49.912 --> 13:52.748
I'm sure the people outside
will decide what happened here.

13:53.999 --> 13:57.461
You two will go to prison
for aiding and abetting murder.

14:00.881 --> 14:02.758
And aren't you ashamed to see your son?

14:04.426 --> 14:07.429
I just did it
because they said they'd give out food!

14:07.513 --> 14:10.599
I didn't know anything! I really didn't!

14:10.683 --> 14:13.185
Food doesn't just fall from the sky.

14:14.061 --> 14:17.690
You knew that someone was going
to get hurt, didn't you?

14:18.566 --> 14:21.026
You were going to
get something if you ignored it.

14:21.110 --> 14:23.028
So you accepted it.

14:23.112 --> 14:24.113
No…

14:25.281 --> 14:27.283
You don't need to be worried so soon.

14:27.867 --> 14:31.620
What matters now is to hang in there
until the lockdown is over.

14:31.704 --> 14:32.746
And…

14:36.375 --> 14:41.839
The couple at Unit 501 promised
to turn on the emergency power.

14:41.922 --> 14:42.965
Right.

14:43.632 --> 14:46.719
Yes, you must turn on the
electricity and take the kid.

14:49.138 --> 14:51.390
If they ask you about why this happened,

14:51.473 --> 14:54.435
just tell them a lunatic
with a gun did it.

14:55.519 --> 14:56.353
So…

14:57.187 --> 14:59.315
are you telling us to keep quiet
about a crime?

15:14.288 --> 15:15.372
What?

15:16.123 --> 15:17.666
I didn't say anything wrong.

15:18.167 --> 15:20.669
Don't mess with those
who have nothing to do with this!

15:22.796 --> 15:24.715
If we attack you at the same time…

15:26.675 --> 15:28.218
you could die too.

15:32.932 --> 15:35.559
Yes, you two have a lot to do,
so you shouldn't fight.

15:37.645 --> 15:42.149
Ms. Na, you don't need
to be here. Go home.

15:42.232 --> 15:43.817
You too, Ms. Shin.

15:44.944 --> 15:48.364
Your husband is at our house
with Seo-yoon right now.

15:49.823 --> 15:53.953
She must've been shocked,
so please protect her at Unit 602.

15:54.578 --> 15:55.746
I will.

16:04.922 --> 16:06.632
Go turn the electricity on.

16:06.715 --> 16:09.760
Then I will let Seo-yoon
and that detective out.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.473
Do you want to come with us?

16:26.360 --> 16:30.030
Seo-yoon, I'm fine.

16:30.531 --> 16:33.534
I'm fine, so why don't you stay outside?

16:33.617 --> 16:37.079
I'm worried because I might've
been infected, that's why.

16:42.418 --> 16:44.336
Stay outside. It's okay.

16:47.381 --> 16:51.385
Mr. Lawyer, can you please
take Seo-yoon to your house?

16:51.468 --> 16:53.345
I don't think she should stay here.

16:54.179 --> 16:55.431
Right.

16:55.514 --> 16:58.183
Stop taking deep breaths,
and come with me. Come.

17:01.520 --> 17:04.440
If you stay here,
that scary guy will come back.

17:04.523 --> 17:07.317
You don't want to get in trouble, do you?

17:08.235 --> 17:11.530
What are you doing?

17:11.613 --> 17:14.867
So-yoon, you came just in time.
Her name sounds similar to yours,

17:14.950 --> 17:16.243
so you persuade her.

17:17.995 --> 17:20.873
Andrew has a gun and he threatened
the couple on the fifth floor.

17:20.956 --> 17:24.251
Yes, he's totally insane.
He must be a murderer or something.

17:24.334 --> 17:25.544
Let's turn a blind eye.

17:25.627 --> 17:28.630
We just need to hide
until the lockdown is over.

17:33.385 --> 17:34.636
Did you help too?

17:34.720 --> 17:36.847
Hey, do I look like someone who'd do that?

17:39.016 --> 17:41.643
I just heard about it from
the building representative.

17:41.727 --> 17:43.687
She said I just need to help them a bit…

17:43.771 --> 17:45.314
This isn't who you were.

17:46.815 --> 17:48.400
When you were a public defender,

17:48.484 --> 17:50.360
you helped those who have been wronged,

17:50.444 --> 17:52.362
and took your time to investigate.

17:52.446 --> 17:54.573
So what did I get from doing that?

17:54.656 --> 17:56.533
I should find a way to live too!

18:01.246 --> 18:02.790
Where did she go?

18:02.873 --> 18:04.249
Kid, let's go. Come here.

18:06.210 --> 18:07.419
Come here.

18:11.673 --> 18:13.467
I want to go with her.

18:19.181 --> 18:20.933
Yes, Seo-yoon, let's go.

18:22.351 --> 18:24.186
But Mr. Kim…

18:35.239 --> 18:36.406
Seo-yoon said

18:37.658 --> 18:39.660
she wants you to come with her.

18:40.494 --> 18:41.370
I'm sorry,

18:42.204 --> 18:44.414
but I don’t think I can climb the stairs.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.625
Please take care of Seo-yoon.

18:49.503 --> 18:50.796
I'm sorry.

19:03.392 --> 19:08.105
We'll go down,
so be careful not to get killed by Andrew.

19:09.565 --> 19:12.985
And think about how you can live
in a less shameful way.

19:16.113 --> 19:19.324
Aren't you going to give us any weapons?
Like baseball bats?

19:19.992 --> 19:22.035
You said the infected
are human beings too.

19:23.036 --> 19:24.621
Talk to them.

19:25.914 --> 19:28.792
When you're done, come here.
We should go see Seo-yoon together.

19:30.669 --> 19:31.503
Wait.

19:34.715 --> 19:36.091
I'll come with you.

20:03.410 --> 20:05.621
It's the senior citizens' center
in Building 103.

20:08.624 --> 20:10.626
- Mr. Kim, wait here.
- What?

20:10.709 --> 20:12.711
It's dangerous. You don't need to go out.

20:12.794 --> 20:14.713
Stay here and go up
when the lights are on.

20:15.631 --> 20:16.965
Is it okay for me to do that?

20:17.633 --> 20:18.800
Why did you follow us?

20:18.884 --> 20:21.428
It doesn't look like
you're here to film stuff, either.

20:22.804 --> 20:24.181
That's my car right there.

20:25.349 --> 20:27.100
I have nowhere to go.

20:28.685 --> 20:31.605
So I want to try breaking out
by hitting the shutter with my car.

20:41.823 --> 20:42.783
Good luck.

20:42.866 --> 20:44.243
All right.

20:44.326 --> 20:45.410
Let's go.

21:02.010 --> 21:02.886
Wait.

21:03.428 --> 21:04.554
That way.

21:17.985 --> 21:20.028
ELECTRICAL ROOM
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

22:14.082 --> 22:15.083
Yi-hyun.

22:16.668 --> 22:19.546
EMERGENCY POWER SUPPLY

22:44.654 --> 22:47.491
The infected will swarm in
when they hear the noise!

23:51.888 --> 23:53.140
This way.

24:08.280 --> 24:09.447
Why did we come this way?

24:11.199 --> 24:14.161
Andrew might try to kill us if we go up.

24:14.244 --> 24:17.289
He'll be waiting at the elevator
or the stairs at our building.

24:17.372 --> 24:20.417
He won't imagine we'd come down
from the next building's rooftop.

24:38.310 --> 24:40.937
There was nobody on
the 15th floor of Building 103.

24:41.021 --> 24:43.648
We just need to take Seo-yoon
and Jung-kook and get out.

24:58.872 --> 25:00.081
Let's go.

25:11.718 --> 25:13.553
What's wrong with this?

25:16.014 --> 25:17.057
Why isn't it working?

25:17.807 --> 25:18.975
Please!

25:33.073 --> 25:35.408
No!

25:37.369 --> 25:38.203
Please!

25:49.256 --> 25:52.259
Andrew, you've done so much work for us.

25:53.927 --> 25:58.181
Shouldn't the gun be managed
officially by the entire apartment?

26:01.810 --> 26:03.019
Andrew.

26:04.479 --> 26:09.234
When the fifth floor couple comes up,
you'll get rid of them, right?

26:13.863 --> 26:16.908
You're going out
when the lockdown is over, right?

26:18.618 --> 26:20.495
Yes, I must go to other apartments.

26:20.578 --> 26:23.999
Everything that happened here
is all your doing, Andrew.

26:24.082 --> 26:25.750
And we knew nothing.

26:26.751 --> 26:28.128
Understood?

26:32.590 --> 26:34.551
You two are okay with it too, right?

26:35.218 --> 26:36.970
Of course. We know nothing.

26:39.097 --> 26:41.433
What are you doing?
We have to go turn on the water.

26:41.516 --> 26:44.352
Get in. You must go
to Unit 501 to get food too.

26:45.770 --> 26:48.106
We'll go there after we go
to the second floor first.

26:48.189 --> 26:49.274
Go ahead.

26:53.445 --> 26:55.822
Why? That Andrew is nothing.

26:55.905 --> 26:59.034
Are you nuts? Do you want to get killed?

27:03.288 --> 27:07.917
Andrew, why have you been
covering that good-looking face?

27:09.377 --> 27:10.462
Go upstairs.

27:10.545 --> 27:12.964
I'm going to kill the cop couple
when they come up.

27:24.559 --> 27:28.188
After we save the others,
can we get them out?

27:28.271 --> 27:30.190
What if Han Tae-seok doesn't take them in?

27:31.733 --> 27:32.859
He will take them in.

27:36.613 --> 27:38.990
You have the antibody.

27:41.743 --> 27:42.577
I do?

27:42.660 --> 27:46.164
So he's trying to take you
by using Seo-yoon as an excuse.

27:47.415 --> 27:50.543
Because you're the only one
in this world who has the antibody.

28:01.638 --> 28:02.680
Stay in there!

28:07.477 --> 28:08.520
Yi-hyun!

28:08.603 --> 28:10.063
What are you doing? Get inside!

28:35.630 --> 28:37.841
Yi-hyun, is this…

28:46.224 --> 28:47.225
I'm sorry.

28:49.519 --> 28:50.520
I couldn't tell you.

28:53.064 --> 28:54.816
I'm sorry I couldn't keep my promise.

29:03.450 --> 29:04.492
I always wanted…

29:05.744 --> 29:07.746
to only show you my good side.

29:37.984 --> 29:39.736
Don't come close to me.

29:41.696 --> 29:42.822
Whenever I see you,

29:44.282 --> 29:47.827
my heart thumps and I feel thirsty.

29:50.246 --> 29:51.289
I do too.

29:54.918 --> 29:56.336
Because I like you.

30:35.792 --> 30:36.751
Come with me.

30:37.585 --> 30:38.878
You will get better.

30:38.962 --> 30:40.505
Because I'll make you get better.

30:48.555 --> 30:51.474
You must have a reason
you're obsessed with this incident.

30:51.558 --> 30:53.768
Even by locking up
the infected in freezer trucks

30:53.852 --> 30:55.603
and sneaking into the apartments.

30:57.313 --> 30:58.606
I got infected.

31:00.525 --> 31:02.318
This will be my last favor.

31:10.201 --> 31:11.035
Yes?

31:12.620 --> 31:15.748
It looks like the emergency power
was turned on inside the apartments.

31:16.875 --> 31:18.418
Remove the parking lot barricades

31:18.501 --> 31:20.503
and block it again
after Ms. Yoon comes out.

31:20.587 --> 31:22.338
Jung Yi-hyun is infected.

31:23.006 --> 31:26.134
Tell them to fire
if he threatens Yoon Sae-bom.

31:31.639 --> 31:32.765
Bo-ram.

31:34.684 --> 31:35.685
Lee Bo-ram!

31:39.564 --> 31:41.024
Bo-ram, open the door.

32:06.674 --> 32:08.176
What are you going to do now?

32:08.259 --> 32:09.969
Is there a way to get rid of Andrew?

32:10.553 --> 32:12.472
The resident-representative-to-be.

32:13.181 --> 32:15.058
I'm sure the police will take care of it.

32:15.600 --> 32:18.019
We can just send him to prison
when things get better.

32:18.603 --> 32:21.439
We didn't know that jerk was a murderer.

32:25.026 --> 32:29.948
- Are you going to say that you knew?
- No. Have it your way, then.

32:30.031 --> 32:34.452
Get lots of food and be happy and healthy.

32:34.535 --> 32:40.333
You must be happy because
you have plans laid out like a movie.

32:47.215 --> 32:48.967
Aren't you taking anything, Mr. Oh?

32:49.050 --> 32:51.844
I have something else to take, so I must…

32:52.887 --> 32:55.890
If you see any drugs, call me right away.

32:55.974 --> 32:58.309
Anything like health supplements
or vitamins.

33:41.978 --> 33:43.479
I was just playing.

33:44.814 --> 33:47.191
I'm just going to find
the drugs and get out.

33:47.775 --> 33:49.736
Want me to give you some if I find them?

33:49.819 --> 33:53.197
If you take it,
then it'll be very hard for you to die.

34:01.998 --> 34:03.332
Hyun-kyung, hurry.

34:04.083 --> 34:05.334
The air conditioner.

34:05.418 --> 34:07.462
Hey, is the lockdown over?

34:07.545 --> 34:09.297
It's absolute chaos outside.

34:10.506 --> 34:12.467
Andrew! That crazy piece of crap!

34:12.550 --> 34:13.676
Why?

34:17.138 --> 34:20.850
He threatened the fifth floor couple
to make them turn on the emergency power.

34:20.933 --> 34:23.227
But didn't Andrew like you?

34:23.311 --> 34:25.480
Damn it! Shut up.

34:28.274 --> 34:29.317
What should we do?

34:30.651 --> 34:32.236
We can't just sit here like this.

34:33.029 --> 34:35.531
Hey, of course we can.

34:35.615 --> 34:38.326
We just need to hide here,
enjoying the air conditioner.

34:39.160 --> 34:40.536
We're powerless.

34:42.663 --> 34:44.665
And I got the disease.

34:48.377 --> 34:49.212
Still,

34:50.046 --> 34:51.631
they did help us.

34:56.803 --> 34:58.471
LOG IN

34:58.554 --> 34:59.388
NO INTERNET CONNECTION

35:08.189 --> 35:09.357
What are you doing?

35:10.566 --> 35:11.567
It's nothing.

35:25.832 --> 35:27.667
You still haven't given up?

35:27.750 --> 35:30.086
The Internet is still out.
What are you trying to do?

35:35.174 --> 35:36.759
You should charge your phone too.

35:36.843 --> 35:37.927
Bring it here.

35:39.428 --> 35:42.056
Go to Unit 501
and bring some water and food.

35:42.640 --> 35:43.516
Me?

35:44.183 --> 35:46.144
Then do you want
to stay here with Seo-yoon?

35:50.565 --> 35:53.734
When everyone takes them,
there will be nothing left for us.

35:59.991 --> 36:01.159
You go next time.

36:26.142 --> 36:28.269
So-yoon, what is this? What are you doing?

36:28.853 --> 36:32.690
You don't care about sacrificing others
and you only care about yourself.

36:32.773 --> 36:36.152
And you justify yourself
by saying you had no other choice.

36:36.652 --> 36:38.613
I'm sick and tired of you!

36:39.155 --> 36:41.115
Hey, So-yoon!

36:41.657 --> 36:42.658
Shin So-yoon!

36:50.666 --> 36:51.709
Be careful.

36:52.835 --> 36:53.961
Don't worry.

36:55.046 --> 36:57.131
Just bring Mr. Kim out safely.

37:08.559 --> 37:11.062
Wait, is this because of Sang-hee?

37:11.145 --> 37:14.315
I told you she and I are not
in that kind of a relationship!

37:14.398 --> 37:17.360
Oh Joo-hyung invested all the money
he pocketed in cryptocurrency.

37:17.443 --> 37:19.445
We were going to share it, that's why!

37:19.528 --> 37:22.406
So I can make you live in luxury.

37:23.991 --> 37:27.203
The world is about to end.
Do you think that'll be worth anything?

37:27.286 --> 37:30.164
No, you obviously don't know anything.

37:30.248 --> 37:33.751
Don't you know what a blockchain is?
That's the value of the future.

37:33.834 --> 37:36.712
Values like that shine more brightly
when the world is in chaos.

37:37.421 --> 37:38.506
What the heck?

37:39.090 --> 37:41.050
Let go! It hurts!

37:41.133 --> 37:42.218
All right. Let go.

37:42.718 --> 37:45.304
Ms. Shin So-yoon, it's me.
Open the door, please.

37:45.388 --> 37:46.430
Sae-bom?

37:47.139 --> 37:47.974
Darn it.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.309
So-yoon, tell her
that it's a misunderstanding.

37:50.393 --> 37:52.937
I protected the kid! That's a fact!

37:53.813 --> 37:54.730
Hurry!

37:54.814 --> 37:56.274
Just let him go.

37:56.357 --> 37:58.276
He's too cowardly to fight back anyway.

38:01.737 --> 38:02.571
Darn it.

38:06.784 --> 38:08.869
You really did come back soon.

38:09.537 --> 38:10.955
I kept our promise, right?

38:12.331 --> 38:14.041
Does your chest still feel stuffy?

38:15.418 --> 38:19.255
But Mr. Kim seemed to be in a lot of pain.

38:19.338 --> 38:20.214
Yes.

38:21.257 --> 38:22.550
He'll be going out with us.

38:31.392 --> 38:32.268
What about Andrew?

38:34.228 --> 38:36.230
I'm sure he's waiting down
there somewhere.

38:36.314 --> 38:38.733
You guys can't get out of here anyway.

38:39.775 --> 38:41.402
We're all trapped in here.

38:53.247 --> 38:54.874
Are you going to kill me here too?

38:55.708 --> 38:57.710
Just like my husband?

39:09.722 --> 39:11.182
Help!

39:12.016 --> 39:13.684
I'm going to die here!

39:15.019 --> 39:16.854
I'm not going out, so don't worry.

39:18.898 --> 39:20.107
Just wait here for a bit.

39:23.361 --> 39:26.739
If we let her take the kid,
that psycho Andrew won't forgive us!

39:26.822 --> 39:29.200
So you want to give the kid to a murderer?

39:30.618 --> 39:33.662
Ms. Shin, we're going to go out.

39:36.123 --> 39:37.458
Want to come with us?

39:39.919 --> 39:40.753
Mr. Kim!

39:43.172 --> 39:45.966
Seo-yoon, I'm happy to see you too,

39:46.050 --> 39:49.303
but I'm in pain. Take it easy, okay?

39:53.808 --> 39:57.937
So-yoon, calm down.
Let's go home and lock the door, okay?

40:00.231 --> 40:02.525
I got to see how filthy
your nature really is.

40:02.608 --> 40:03.818
We're done.

40:14.662 --> 40:15.496
So-yoon!

40:25.506 --> 40:26.674
This is yours.

40:31.762 --> 40:32.763
Thank you.

40:56.412 --> 40:57.872
Damn it, I said I won't!

40:57.955 --> 40:59.206
You saw the look in his eyes.

40:59.290 --> 41:01.083
- Please stop it!
- Let go!

41:01.167 --> 41:03.878
We collected all that money for our kid…

41:06.130 --> 41:08.048
Andrew. We were just…

41:08.883 --> 41:11.886
Stay here. When the fifth floor couple
comes up, hold them.

41:12.678 --> 41:15.681
I… Andrew.

41:16.599 --> 41:20.311
I'll pay you by the hour,
at least. Please.

41:27.776 --> 41:30.362
I can take you down
if you don't have this gun…

41:30.905 --> 41:32.198
Honey! You can do it!

41:32.281 --> 41:33.115
Go!

41:33.616 --> 41:34.658
Go!

41:38.621 --> 41:40.956
Hey, get off of him! Damn it!

41:41.040 --> 41:41.916
Let him go!

41:53.302 --> 41:54.220
Oh no!

41:54.303 --> 41:56.138
Should I pull it out? What do I do?

41:56.222 --> 41:57.556
Should I pull it out?

41:57.640 --> 42:00.100
Ma'am, don't pull that knife out.

42:00.184 --> 42:01.435
He'll die if you do.

42:13.072 --> 42:15.199
This is some serious diet.

42:17.952 --> 42:20.079
We're almost there. Hang in there a bit.

42:23.457 --> 42:25.334
Bo-ram, do you want to come with us too?

42:26.585 --> 42:27.795
Can I do that?

42:37.054 --> 42:38.264
Yoon Sae-bom.

43:01.245 --> 43:02.830
I'll keep him here, so go!

43:02.913 --> 43:05.291
What are you talking about?
You should come with us!

43:26.103 --> 43:27.521
I'm sorry I can't go with you.

43:32.484 --> 43:33.485
Yi-hyun!

43:39.450 --> 43:40.701
Sae-bom.

43:43.078 --> 43:44.121
I was truly happy…

43:46.790 --> 43:48.250
to be with you.

43:50.586 --> 43:51.920
What are you saying?

43:52.588 --> 43:54.340
Open the door, now!

43:55.174 --> 43:56.216
Go.

43:57.176 --> 43:58.344
Never give up.

44:01.221 --> 44:02.890
Yi-hyun!

44:10.564 --> 44:12.191
I think someone's coming up.

44:23.285 --> 44:24.453
Don't mess with Yi-hyun.

44:25.371 --> 44:26.705
I'm going to be back soon.

44:27.915 --> 44:29.166
Let's go.

44:35.631 --> 44:36.548
Hey.

44:37.174 --> 44:38.967
That's a new model, so it won't break.

44:39.718 --> 44:40.636
Wait.

44:44.473 --> 44:45.391
Want this?

44:58.654 --> 45:01.865
Jung Yi-hyun throws a pitch,

45:01.949 --> 45:04.493
and the ball hits the mitt!

45:06.036 --> 45:07.996
Andrew, the batter, can't do anything.

45:09.248 --> 45:11.417
That was a fast pitch. It was fast.

45:11.917 --> 45:15.421
Jung Yi-hyun is back after a long hiatus,

45:15.504 --> 45:18.882
and he threw the best pitch of his life!

45:29.351 --> 45:33.480
Hey, if I didn't get injured,
I could've gone to the Major League.

45:39.111 --> 45:41.321
Your wife ran away,
and you're okay with it?

45:42.364 --> 45:43.490
Yes, this is great.

45:44.908 --> 45:48.120
I started liking her
after meeting her at a place like this.

45:50.330 --> 45:51.623
On a sunny day…

45:53.542 --> 45:55.586
with a beautiful blue sky.

45:58.380 --> 45:59.715
And it's great

46:01.675 --> 46:02.885
to let her go…

46:05.512 --> 46:07.139
on a day like this,

46:07.848 --> 46:10.058
and at a place like this in the end.

46:27.784 --> 46:29.203
That's no fun.

46:32.080 --> 46:33.457
Look at me.

46:34.291 --> 46:37.294
Where's the fun in killing
if I can't look into the victim's eyes?

47:20.504 --> 47:21.964
What does this even say?

47:47.948 --> 47:51.827
Sang-hee, So-yoon ran away.

47:52.869 --> 47:53.870
That's good.

47:54.746 --> 47:56.748
There's something you must do for me.

47:58.041 --> 47:59.167
About Oh Joo-hyung…

48:00.085 --> 48:01.128
What the heck?

48:02.546 --> 48:05.424
It must be high blood pressure.
He suddenly collapsed.

48:09.886 --> 48:12.180
Look at this writing.

48:12.681 --> 48:14.016
What does this say?

48:21.481 --> 48:22.316
- Hey.
- What?

48:23.942 --> 48:24.776
Right.

48:26.278 --> 48:28.864
Isn't that cursive for doctors?
For writing prescriptions.

48:28.947 --> 48:31.074
Don't you know? You worked at that clinic.

48:31.700 --> 48:33.243
I only do consultations.

48:33.910 --> 48:35.120
Don't you have your phone?

48:35.871 --> 48:38.248
I left it at home…

48:40.542 --> 48:42.336
He's alive.

48:46.423 --> 48:48.967
Mister, is that something
for your blood pressure?

49:11.448 --> 49:12.699
Here.

49:14.451 --> 49:15.702
Read it carefully.

49:18.330 --> 49:22.459
If we get it wrong ten times,
then we can't get the money.

49:22.542 --> 49:24.920
Okay, I'll read it carefully.

50:35.949 --> 50:38.535
You have to get up!
Put some strength into your legs!

50:38.618 --> 50:39.995
You need to get up!

50:40.078 --> 50:42.122
I can't put any strength into my legs!

50:42.205 --> 50:43.957
Get up!

50:44.040 --> 50:46.793
Building representative, please help!

50:46.877 --> 50:48.336
My husband is hurt!

50:48.420 --> 50:49.629
Please help us!

50:49.713 --> 50:51.089
What happened?

50:52.048 --> 50:53.550
Andrew stabbed him.

50:54.259 --> 50:55.802
Don't talk to her!

50:55.886 --> 50:57.971
It's all her fault! Damn it!

51:01.016 --> 51:03.351
What about the others? Have you seen them?

51:05.604 --> 51:07.731
What about Andrew? Where did he go?

51:08.315 --> 51:09.858
To the 15th floor.

51:30.504 --> 51:31.671
Hurry and get in.

52:35.861 --> 52:36.903
It's okay.

52:37.612 --> 52:38.947
They're all on our side.

52:56.548 --> 52:59.217
Give me a gun so I can go bring Yi-hyun.

53:29.456 --> 53:31.791
Let go of me!

54:02.030 --> 54:03.740
SEYANG CITY HALL, SEYANG NEW TOWN

55:01.506 --> 55:02.549
Yi-hyun…

55:27.282 --> 55:29.034
Has the Martial Law been lifted?

55:31.453 --> 55:33.038
And you kept it from us?

55:38.585 --> 55:43.673
I'm sure it was to manage
the quarantine areas effectively.

55:44.924 --> 55:46.092
And then…

55:47.552 --> 55:49.971
you realized I had the antibody,
and pulled me out.

55:51.681 --> 55:54.476
We gave you the antidote,
so you'll feel quite dizzy.

55:55.226 --> 55:56.269
Lie in bed for a while.

56:03.735 --> 56:05.028
Here is your phone.

56:09.449 --> 56:12.577
- Where did you get this?
- From Detective Kim Jung-kook.

56:13.995 --> 56:14.871
He told me…

56:16.206 --> 56:18.249
that Mr. Jung told him
to take it with him.

56:33.515 --> 56:35.016
I have to go find Yi-hyun.

56:37.268 --> 56:38.770
Is it really worth it?

56:40.980 --> 56:42.649
Wasn't it a marriage of convenience?

56:43.233 --> 56:45.902
There are a lot of people outside
that you should protect.

56:47.112 --> 56:48.446
Remember what you said to me?

56:50.406 --> 56:53.451
That if something goes wrong,
the world may collapse.

56:54.994 --> 56:57.247
I'm sorry about what happened to Mr. Jung.

56:57.330 --> 57:00.041
But when the cure is developed
and things are resolved,

57:00.792 --> 57:02.085
you might not lose…

57:04.212 --> 57:05.755
the things you wanted.

57:06.589 --> 57:08.508
Tell the world it'll have to wait.

57:10.301 --> 57:11.803
I have to see Yi-hyun.

57:15.849 --> 57:17.058
If I lose him…

57:21.396 --> 57:22.939
my world may really collapse.

57:27.652 --> 57:29.195
I want to show someone to you.

57:34.868 --> 57:36.494
Is she infected?

57:37.704 --> 57:41.082
Her seizure stopped,
thanks to your plasma,

57:41.166 --> 57:42.709
but she won't be able to last.

57:44.586 --> 57:48.298
We brought you with the excuse
of excessive tranquilizer injections.

57:48.381 --> 57:51.342
We'll check your condition today
and tomorrow, and if you're okay,

57:51.426 --> 57:52.969
you'll go to the governmental lab.

57:53.720 --> 57:58.391
To a lab with Biosafety Level 4,
where outsiders can't enter.

58:00.643 --> 58:01.811
What do you want?

58:05.940 --> 58:09.944
She'll be cured only if she gets
one more injection of your plasma.

58:11.321 --> 58:13.031
Then let's help each other.

58:13.114 --> 58:15.283
I'll give you my plasma
or anything you ask for…

58:16.784 --> 58:18.369
so help me go back home.

58:19.579 --> 58:22.123
And keep the electricity on
at the apartments until then.

58:23.708 --> 58:24.709
The emergency power

58:25.627 --> 58:26.711
can't last that long.

58:29.380 --> 58:30.757
Do you think…

58:33.551 --> 58:35.011
Mr. Jung is alive?

58:41.017 --> 58:42.018
Of course.

59:23.726 --> 59:25.353
ALBUM

59:28.856 --> 59:30.233
TO SAE-BOM

59:32.443 --> 59:35.446
Ta-da! Hi, Sae-bom.

59:37.615 --> 59:39.659
I'm sorry I couldn't propose
to you properly.

59:41.619 --> 59:42.704
It must have seemed

59:44.372 --> 59:47.000
like I agreed to marry you
because of the house.

59:48.376 --> 59:49.586
But that's not why.

59:51.212 --> 59:53.298
I was just worried
that you'd misunderstand

59:54.340 --> 59:55.758
because I said yes so quickly.

59:56.384 --> 59:58.303
I'm not such an easy guy, you know.

59:59.762 --> 01:00:01.639
Of course, the house is important, too…

01:00:03.016 --> 01:00:06.519
but what's really important is
whom I'm going to be with, right?

01:00:08.354 --> 01:00:11.065
Mister, what are you doing
with Sae-bom's phone?

01:00:11.149 --> 01:00:14.986
Seo-yoon, act like you didn't see that.
They're being lovey-dovey…

01:00:15.069 --> 01:00:17.739
Wait, no. Just think
that he's invisible now.

01:00:17.822 --> 01:00:20.074
Let's go.

01:00:22.410 --> 01:00:26.080
I hope we can go out safely
and watch this video together.

01:00:28.082 --> 01:00:31.294
When that happens, I'll tell you properly…

01:00:33.463 --> 01:00:34.589
that I like you.

01:00:52.482 --> 01:00:55.485
Ta-da! Hi, Sae-bom.

01:00:57.612 --> 01:00:59.697
I'm sorry I couldn't propose
to you properly.

01:01:01.699 --> 01:01:02.867
It must have seemed

01:01:04.452 --> 01:01:07.080
like I agreed to marry you
because of the house.

01:01:08.414 --> 01:01:09.749
But that's not why.

01:01:11.125 --> 01:01:14.420
I was just worried
that you'd misunderstand

01:01:14.504 --> 01:01:16.255
because I said yes so quickly.

01:01:16.339 --> 01:01:18.341
I'm not such an easy guy, you know.

01:01:19.759 --> 01:01:21.552
Of course, the house is important, too…

01:01:23.096 --> 01:01:28.434
WONJUNG DORMITORY

01:02:00.258 --> 01:02:01.843
I bit Andrew.

01:02:02.927 --> 01:02:05.179
If he's alive, then we must catch him.

01:02:07.223 --> 01:02:09.475
I'm sure he hid Andrew's body
and lied to me.

01:02:09.559 --> 01:02:11.436
I can kill him too if something happens.

01:02:11.519 --> 01:02:13.271
The antibodies are decreasing.

01:02:13.354 --> 01:02:14.981
So we should kill the detective?

01:02:16.315 --> 01:02:18.067
They're infected.

01:02:18.151 --> 01:02:21.404
You people are the monsters,
not those with the disease.

01:02:22.113 --> 01:02:24.449
I will take care of Yoon Sae-bom.

01:02:24.532 --> 01:02:25.533
What about Yi-hyun?

01:02:25.616 --> 01:02:27.034
Is he alive?

01:02:29.412 --> 01:02:34.417
Subtitle translation by: Hae-lim Lee
